testuser@example.com / Test@1234, buses BUS001-BUS004 on routes Mumbai-Pune,
Bangalore-Chennai, Delhi-Jaipur, current date 2024-02-10, current time 08:00.

Write your automated test(s) at the bottom, under the TODO marker, using
